;; `test` is deliberately NOT in :paths.
;;
;; A consumer takes this port as a git dependency with :deps/root "clojure",
;; and every path listed here lands on THEIR classpath. omni's own self-test
;; namespaces (voxgig.omni.test.*) are not part of the runner and have no
;; business being shipped to a consumer - the clojure form of register 4.15,
;; "a shim must not put its own tree on a consumer's module path".
;;
;; The :test alias adds it back for omni's own `make test`.
{:paths ["src"]
 :deps {}
 :aliases {:test {:extra-paths ["test"]}}}
